<title>USA: BetzDearborn Inc Q1 net shr primary $0.59.</title>
<headline>BetzDearborn Inc Q1 net shr primary $0.59.</headline>
<dateline>TREVOSE, Pa. 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>BETZDEARBORN INC</p>
<p>		     CONSOLIDATED STATEMENTS OF OPERATIONS</p>
<p>		    (In millions, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>						    Three Months Ended</p>
<p>							 March 31,</p>
<p>					   1997			  1996</p>
<p> Net sales			   $306.4			$199.5</p>
<p>Operating costs and expenses:</p>
<p>					  265.8			 167.8</p>
<p> OPERATING EARNINGS		  40.6			  31.7</p>
<p>Other income (expense):</p>
<p>  Investment and other income   (0.4)			   0.3</p>
<p>  Interest expense		 (11.4)			 (0.5)</p>
<p>					 (11.8)			 (0.2)</p>
<p> NET EARNINGS			  18.6			  19.7</p>
<p>Net earnings per Common Share:</p>
<p>  Primary				0.59			  0.66</p>
<p>  Fully diluted			0.56			  0.62</p>
<p>Average number of Common Shares:</p>
<p>  Primary				29.1			  27.8</p>
<p>  Fully diluted			31.8			  30.7</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
<p>Note: The company reported its earnings increase reflects the acquisition of W.R. Grace's Dearborn business in June of 1996.</p>
<p>The company reported that excluding integration costs, net earings for the quarter were $22.8 million compared to $19.7 million for the same period last year, an increase of 16%.</p>
<p>Fully diluted earnings per share, excluding integration costs, were $0.70 compared to $0.62 in 1996, an increase of 13%.</p>
<p>Total integration costs for the quarter were $6.6 million.</p>
